/**

@page applications_exahype2_shallow_water_radial_dam_break Radial Dam Break

Scenario simulating a radial dam break enclosed by a dry bathymetry ring.

\f{align*}{
r &= \sqrt{(\frac{N}{2} - x)^2 + (\frac{N}{2} - y)^2}, \\
h(x, y, 0) &= \begin{cases}
  1.1 & \text{if } r \leq{} \frac{N}{10} \\
  0.0 & \text{if } 2\frac{N}{10} \leq{} r \leq{} 3\frac{N}{10} \\
  1.0 & \text{otherwise} \\
\end{cases}, \\
hu(x, y, 0) &= 0.0, \\
hv(x, y, 0) &= 0.0, \\
b(x, y) &= \begin{cases}
  1.2 & \text{if } 2\frac{N}{10} \leq{} r \leq{} 3\frac{N}{10} \\
  0.0 & \text{otherwise} \\
\end{cases},
\f}

where @f$ (x, y) \in [0, N] \times [0, N] @f$ in meters.

*/
